0 Ellipse Engine - one-motor twin elliptical tracer
0 Name: ellipse-engine.ldr
0 Author: Designed with ChatGPT for the user
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE CC0-1.0 for the original assembly arrangement; see LICENSE.md.
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub; one SPIKE medium angular motor on port A.
0 // Two perpendicular, physically paired guides constrain one rigid coupler.
0 // Carriage hinge span 80 LDU; trace points +/-100 LDU from its midpoint.
0 // Tip paths: perpendicular ellipses, 280 x 120 LDU = 112 x 48 mm.
0 // The motor moves with the upper carriage. Leave a slack cable loop.
0 // Normal hub battery and flexible motor cable are not separately modelled.
0 // Colour markers trace paths in space; no physical pen or ink layer is claimed.
